plantuml-in-go
==============

This project is a Go reimplementation of PlantUML (https://plantuml.com,
https://github.com/plantuml/plantuml).

Upstream origin
---------------

Source files that carry a "Provenance: plantuml-mit 1.2026.8 <path>" header
are translations of the MIT-licensed variant of PlantUML v1.2026.8, as
published on Maven Central:

    net.sourceforge.plantuml:plantuml-mit:1.2026.8:sources

    (C) Copyright 2009-2024, Arnaud Roques
    Licensed under the MIT License.

Files with a "Provenance: fdlibm 5.3 <file>" header are translations of
fdlibm, the C math library behind Java's StrictMath:

